      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd personally be pretty worried of this getting abused and used in reverse. Someone could easily add triggering content to an otherwise normal world that only appears for people who don't want to see them.\n\nYou could argue that this then could only be an option for worlds who are actually tagged, but I'd still be worried of the same thing. (Not to mention that the current state of the system makes it impossible to join a world that has content warnings if you have them filtered unless you disable the filters, rendering this pointless)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
